<title>UK: Nestle adds 100 mln rand to 3-year bond.</title>
<headline>Nestle adds 100 mln rand to 3-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 200 million rand from 100 million rand, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p>There is a new issue price.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NESTLE FINANCE FRANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  NESTLE SA</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN RAND  COUPON     14.75 PCT MATURITY    24.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.20    PAY DATE    24.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWISS     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
